<title>SWITZERLAND: Winterthur to have statement on Ebner.</title>
<headline>Winterthur to have statement on Ebner.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Winterthur Insurance declined initial comment on investor Martin Ebner's assertion that Swiss Re held a stake of at least five percent in Wintherthur, but said it would issue a statement later.</p>
<p>&quot;We will have something but it is still a bit too early,&quot; a company spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Ebner made the remark to reporters based on a letter he said he received from Winterthur.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
